\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  - Taiwan falls cushioned, won tamed. \b0\par\par\uc2 690 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2000\par 09:00\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      SINGAPORE, March 16 (Reuters) - Regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were \par \par \uc2  little changed after a quiet Asian session with markets in \par \par \uc2  Singapore, Indonesia and Malaysia shut for a Moslem holiday. \par \par \uc2      The euro was a little easier on both the yen and the dollar \par \par \uc2  as the market failed to find any concrete evidence of the \par \par \uc2  rumoured Bank of Japan \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on euro/yen. \par \par \uc2      There was much speculation that MOF's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief Haruhiko \par \par \uc2  Kuroda, who has just returned from an OECD meeting in France, \par \par \uc2  may have met ECB officials to discuss \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2      The euro was helped by speculation the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2  Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will raise interest rates later on Thursday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     TAIWAN DOLLAR\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Taiwan dollar was shielded from the misfortunes of the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par stock market, keeping to a tight range despite mainland Chinese\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par threats to "shed blood" if Taiwan opted for independence.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     While sentiment towards Taiwan has soured in recent weeks\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ahead of presidential elections this Saturday, downside in the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has been cushioned by \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Mainland Chinese Premier Zhu Rongji said the Chinese were\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ready to "shed blood" to stop Taiwan from breaking away and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par urged voters to not to act "on impulse".\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par KOREAN WON\tab     -2\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Verbal and actual \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 South Korea\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's Finance\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Ministry blunted won gains spurred by persistent stock buying\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par by foreigners.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Foreign funds soaked up 40.3 billion won worth of stocks by\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0215 GMT after buying 95.4 billion won worth on Wednesday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Finance Ministry reiterated it was ready to take action\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par if necessary to stabilise the rate.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Appreciation in the won was not desirable for the country's\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par economy given the recent trend in the trade account, it said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     THAI BAHT\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The baht slipped amid concerns of further delay to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par restructuring plans for Thailand's biggest debtor, Thai\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Petrochemical Industry (TPI)   .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Bangkok dealers said a landmark ruling in favour of TPI\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par creditors the previous day had been well-received but that\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par there were concerns that existing TPI management had been left\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par in place.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par This gave the impression that the management, sitting on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par unpaid debts of $3.4 billion, had won a partial victory, they\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par INDONESIAN RUPIAH\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The rupiah was barely changed in thin offshore trade,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par caught in a tight 7,415 to 7,480 per dollar band.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par A positive outlook for Indonesian growth in 2000 and 2001\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par fuelled hopes the rupiah would appreciate to around the 6,685\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par level by year-end, dealers said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Gross domestic product (GDP) is forecast to rise 3.86\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par percent in 2000 and 4.95 percent in 2001, according to a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Reuters poll.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par PHILIPPINE PESO\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The peso was slightly easier after dollar demand by\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par corporates to repay external liabilities emerged above the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 40.90 level.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Manila dealers said players had been watching movement in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the baht in the absence of fresh market leads.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The peso sometimes tracks the baht as the Philippines and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Thailand share similar export markets.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     SINGAPORE DOLLAR\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Singapore dollar remained pressured in holiday-thinned\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par offshore trade though it was comfortably off an overnight low\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of 1.7145 per dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Strong Sing dollar support was still seen at the $1.7160\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par level.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Change on the day\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid     Prev Close    Pct Move\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Japan yen     105.47\tab  105.83\tab    +0.34\par  Sing dlr\tab 1.7130\tab  1.7099\tab    -0.18\par  Taiwan dlr    30.771\tab  30.742\tab    -0.09\par  Korean won   1117.00\tab 1118.20\tab    +0.11\par  Baht\tab      37.95\tab   37.85\tab    -0.26\par  Peso\tab      40.94\tab   40.93\tab    -0.02\par  Rupiah\tab  7425.00\tab 7430.00\tab    +0.07\par  Ringgit\tab  3.7995\tab  3.7995\tab    +0.00\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Change on year\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \tab Latest     End prev yr     Pct Move\par  Japan yen     105.47\tab  102.21\tab    -3.09\par  Sing dlr\tab 1.7130\tab  1.6640\tab    -2.86\par  Taiwan dlr    30.771\tab  31.380\tab    +1.98\par  Korean won   1117.00\tab 1135.00\tab    +1.61\par  Baht\tab      37.95\tab   37.45\tab    -1.32\par  Peso\tab      40.94\tab   40.20\tab    -1.81\par  Rupiah\tab  7425.00\tab 6975.00\tab    -6.06\par  Ringgit\tab  3.7995\tab  3.8000\tab    +0.01\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     ((Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Desk (65) 870-3087\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par email:asia.\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 @reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 2000.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw3g04jnb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
