\par\par \b \uc2  S.Korea Won Dn Early; Local Bks Buy Dlrs To Up Provisions \b0\par\par\uc2 232 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Juli 1999\par 03:34\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SEOUL (Dow Jones)--The South Korean won is down early Thursday against the U.S. dollar as local banks buy the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in an apparent effort to increase their bad loan provisions, traders say. \par \par \uc2  Around 0059 GMT (8:59 p.m. Wednesday EDT), the dollar was trading at 1,176.40 won, up from Wednesday's closing level of KRW1,173. \par \par \uc2  The dollar appeared well supported early Thursday as local banks buy dollars in an apparent effort to increase their dollar reserves for potential bad loans, traders said. The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also being supported by the selling of local stocks by foreign investors, traders said. \par \par \uc2  In addition, the market remains vigilant of the government's determination to slow the won's recent rise, traders said. The Bank of Korea, \b \highlight22\uc2 South Korea\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  recently in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to support the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a bid to protect Korean exporters. However, no direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen early Thursday, they said. \par \par \uc2  "The government's intention to raise the dollar rate is so strong," said a Seoul market watcher. \par \par \uc2  Traders expect the dollar to trade Thursday between KRW1,172 and KRW1,180. \par \par \uc2  -By Louis Hau; 822-732-2165; lhau@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 08-07-99 \par \par \uc2  0134GMT \par \par \uc2  1063 1858 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv78052zw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
