\par\par \b \uc2  ASIA  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2  - End week locked in tight ranges. \b0\par\par\uc2 797 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Juni 1999\par 11:38\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      0900 GMT - Dollar-yen moved in a narrow range in Asian \par \par \uc2  trade tracking between 118.50 and 119.05 yen as traders feared \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of Japan (BOJ). \par \par \uc2      With the yen more stable, the regionals took the day off \par \par \uc2  with some ending unchanged from opening quotes although with a \par \par \uc2  firmer bias. \par \par \uc2      *** The Korean won bucked the trend falling very slightly a \par \par \uc2  day after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem the won's rise. \par \par \uc2      The IMF has reaffirmed \b \highlight22\uc2 South Korea\b0 \highlight\uc2  faced no restraints in \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth day-to-day volatility on the local \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2      "Since the beginning of the IMF-supported programme, there \par \par \uc2  has never been any intention to constrain the authorities in \par \par \uc2  their day-to-day smoothing out of volatility of the exchange \par \par \uc2  rate," the IMF's chief representative in Korea John Dodsworth \par \par \uc2  told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  The statement followed confirmation from the Korean finance \par \par \uc2  ministry that the goverment had been \b \highlight22\uc2 interventing\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market \par \par \uc2  this week to stem the rise in the won. \par \par \uc2  "The purpose is to maintain the supply and demand, to \par \par \uc2  maintain a balanced market," ministry spokeswoman Kang \par \par \uc2  Yeoun-sun told Reuters Television in an interview. \par \par \uc2  Local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Korea had \par \par \uc2  stepped into the market on Wednesday and Thursday and bought an \par \par \uc2  estimated $150 million to $160 million over the two days. \par \par \uc2      *** The Philippine \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced it will cut its \par \par \uc2  key overnight rates by 12.5 basis points each on Monday. \par \par \uc2      This will be the 17th cut this year in overnight rates for \par \par \uc2  a total of 387.5 basis points and is aimed at spurring banks to \par \par \uc2  lend and boost economic recovery. The cuts will bring down the \par \par \uc2  overnight borrowing rate to 9.5 percent and the overnight \par \par \uc2  lending to 11.5 percent. \par \par \uc2  *** The Japanese government announced a supplementary \par \par \uc2  budget will be necessary to finance the latest economic \par \par \uc2  stimulus measures which are designed to boost employment. \par \par \uc2  Japanese Prime Minister Keizo Obuchi said he had instructed \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Kiichi Miyazawa to consider as quickly as \par \par \uc2  possible the size of a budget to finance the jobs package. \par \par \uc2  "I think it will be unavoidable to compile a supplementary \par \par \uc2  budget, but it will be a bit different from the usual \par \par \uc2  supplementary budgets compiled for economic (stimulus) \par \par \uc2  packages," Obuchi said. \par \par \uc2  The employment package will aim to create more than 700,000 \par \par \uc2  news jobs through a series of subsidies and incentives for \par \par \uc2  employers to hire job seekers. \par \par \uc2  *** The Indonesian rupiah maintianed its firmer tone \par \par \uc2  despite the snail like pace of the election count. Preliminary \par \par \uc2  results as at 0840 GMT on Friday from the General Election \par \par \uc2  Commission showed a total percentage of vote counted at 13.98 \par \par \uc2  pct. \par \par \uc2  Indonesian Democratic Party-Struggle (PDI-P) had about \par \par \uc2  38.44 percent, the Nation Awakening Party (PKB) had 20.04 and \par \par \uc2  Golkar 15.96 percent. \par \par \uc2  *** Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Syahril Sabirin said \par \par \uc2  that senior officers of recapitalised banks who do not meet \par \par \uc2  anti-corruption standards would have to leave their banks by \par \par \uc2  the end of the month. \par \par \uc2  "The timetable has been set up," he told reporters. \par \par \uc2  *** Thailand's foreign reserves stood at $30.6 billion on \par \par \uc2  June 4, unchanged from $30.6 billion on May 28 and the same \par \par \uc2  level on May 21, the Bank of Thailand said. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Thailand also said it had net forward \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2  exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  contracts to buy Thai baht of $3.5 billion on June 4, \par \par \uc2  unchanged from $3.5 billion on May 28 and down from $3.6 \par \par \uc2  billion on May 21. \par \par \uc2  *** The Hong Kong Association of Banks said on Friday it \par \par \uc2  was leaving deposit interest rates unchanged at 3.50 percent. \par \par \uc2  The bankers' group last changed rates on April 30, cutting \par \par \uc2  deposit rates by 25 basis points. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCIES\b0 \highlight\uc2  VS U.S. DOLLAR \par \par \uc2  Change on the day FRI 11 0916GMT \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ...Latest bid....Prev Close....Pct Move \par \par \uc2   Ringgit......3.7995.......3.8000.........0.01% \par \par \uc2   Rupiah......7670.00......7635.00........-0.46% \par \par \uc2   Baht..........36.91........36.94.........0.08% \par \par \uc2   Peso..........37.85........37.80........-0.13% \par \par \uc2   Sing dlr.....1.7134.......1.7155.........0.12% \par \par \uc2   Taiwan dlr...32.41