\par\par \b \uc2  S.Korea won weaker by midday on  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 264 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Januar 1999\par 04:49\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SEOUL, Jan 21 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 South Korea\b0 \highlight\uc2 's won ended Thursday's morning trade weaker against the dollar after state-controlled banks \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  and bought dollars, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said Kookmin Bank bought a large amount of dollars early in the morning after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  asked the bank to try to halt the won's rise against the U.S. unit. \par \par \uc2  After opening at 1,170.0, the won fell to 1,185.0 after Kookmin bought dollars but officials at Kookmin Bank denied the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  talk. \par \par \uc2  The won stood at 1,174.0 per dollar by lunch break from Wednesday's 1,165.5 close. \par \par \uc2  "Kookmin bought dollars heavily early in the morning to support the U.S. unit against the won," said a domestic bank dealer who asked not to be identified. \par \par \uc2  The dealer gave no further details. \par \par \uc2  Dollar buying by Korea Electric Power Corp  also helped bring the won down in the morning, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said such dollar buying forces emerged after President Kim Dae-jung said on Wednesday he wanted the won/dollar level to remain at about 1,200 won because of concerns about how a stronger \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  would impact exports. \par \par \uc2  "The dollar buying seems to be aimed at controlling the speed of the won's rise," said another local bank dealer. \par \par \uc2  Dealers forecast the won would remain in a 1,170-1,185 range in the afternoon. \par \par \uc2  ((Nick Yon, Seoul newsroom, +822 727 5644, fax +822 727 5666, seoul.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv1l061s3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
